Add the following snippet to your `claude_desktop_config.json` to connect pyadi-jif to
Claude Desktop:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "pyadi-jif": {
      "command": "jifmcp",
      "args": []
    }
  }
}
```


The config file is located at:

- **macOS**: `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/clau
